@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Get coefficients by class (replace 1 with actual class ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/class/1

### Get coefficients by subject (replace 1 with actual subject ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/subject/1

### Get coefficient by subject and class (replace IDs with actual values)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/subject/1/class/1

### Get coefficient value by subject and class (replace IDs with actual values)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/value/subject/1/class/1

### Get all coefficients
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/all

### Save a single coefficient
POST {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "coefficient": 2.5,
  "isActive": true
}

### Bulk save coefficients for a class (replace 1 with actual class ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/bulk-save/class/1
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "subjectId": 1,
    "coefficient": 2.5,
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "subjectId": 2,
    "coefficient": 3.0,
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "subjectId": 3,
    "coefficient": 1.5,
    "isActive": true
  }
]

### Deactivate coefficient (replace 1 with actual coefficient ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/1/deactivate

### Delete coefficient (replace 1 with actual coefficient ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/1
